cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the archived release and the exact commit used."
title: "FractalGuard RAG: Authorization-first, geometry-aware retrieval governance"
abstract: >-
  A research implementation for authorization-filtered vector retrieval. A
  deterministic policy fixes the searchable document universe before any
  geometry is measured. Query-local multiscale geometry then selects search
  effort inside that authorized universe. The repository includes exact
  authorized ground truth, HNSW counterfactual replay, fail-closed controls,
  drift scenarios, a preregistered evaluation protocol, and a synthetic pilot.
